flowchart LR
    Client[Retained client socket] --> Preflight[Bound preflight]
    Preflight --> ProcNet[Bounded proc net table snapshot]
    ProcNet --> Tuple[Match reverse tuple and inode]
    Tuple --> ProcFd[Scan visible same-UID proc fd links]
    ProcFd --> Lease[Retained process lease]
    Lease --> Evidence[Unqualified connection evidence]
    Reuse[Tuple and inode reuse window remains] -. limits .-> Evidence
